Change only these directly related source documentation lines. Preserve the documented HTTP status rules, exception precedence, _OTHER behavior and helper links. Do not alter HttpCommonAttributesGetter, HttpErrorType, runtime behavior, tests, signatures, CHANGELOG or other documentation. Do not add migration explanations or statements about historical extractor fallback. Apply narrow formatting if needed; behavioral tests are unnecessary for this documentation-only edit. Do not alter the PR title or description, which the coordinator owns. Do not update other PRs, wait for CI, merge main or sibling branches, rebase, reply to humans or resolve unrelated threads.

